<title>INDIA: Indian Shipping -- Cochin cargoes - Jan 7.</title>
<headline>Indian Shipping -- Cochin cargoes - Jan 7.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is the berthing schedule of major vessels loading and unloading at India's Cochin port on January 7:</p>
<p> Commodity	    Tons	    Ship		     Berthing</p>
<p>		     (LDD/ULD)</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Muriate Of</p>
<p> Potash	    27,000 (ULD)     Flag Tom		 03/01</p>
<p>High Speed</p>
<p> Diesel	    10,000 (LDD)     Jag Praja		07/01</p>
<p>Plywood	     2,300 (LDD)     Reef Anguja	    05/01</p>
<p>Sulphur	    10,100 (ULD)     Dubai Liberty	  05/01</p>
<p>Fuel Oil	   12,000 (LDD)     Kollandia		06/01</p>
<p>Crude		47,000 (ULD)     Dhansingh Tapu	 06/01</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>		  Note:</p>
<p>	    LDD - Loading</p>
<p>	    ULD - Unloading</p>
<p>(Source: J.M.Baxi &amp; Co, Cochin)</p>
